OL,3,GNEWSAPupils say classroom mobile phone
OL,4,Aban 'stopped us messing about'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the bell sounds to announce the
OL,7,Fstart of third period, teachers at
OL,8,FBelmont Academy are stationed all along
OL,9,Fthe corridor, manning their classroom
OL,10,Fdoors with big plastic boxes.
OL,12,FThe pupils say good morning and as part
OL,13,Fof a "phone-free classroom" policy,
OL,14,Fthey then deposit their phones in a
OL,15,Frectangular foam slot within the box
OL,16,Fbefore entering the room.
OL,18,FThe box is then locked away until the
OL,19,Flesson is over.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
