OL,3,GNEWSAPupils say classroom mobile phone
OL,4,Aban 'stopped us messing about'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's genuinely been the best thing
OL,7,Fwe've ever done", says Lynsey Pollock,
OL,8,Fthe principal teacher of social
OL,9,Fsubjects at the school in Ayr.
